/typings

# System Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

.nx/cache
.nx/workspace-data
.cursor/rules/nx-rules.mdc
.github/instructions/nx.instructions.md

# sdlc-controls gate: all generated per run, never committed.
# The component map is a projection of the Nx graph — see
# docs/sdlc-controls-integration.md. CI writes these to $RUNNER_TEMP;
# tools/sdlc-controls/verify.sh writes them here, inside the repo, so a
# local run leaves the same record on disk that CI uploads.
/.sdlc-controls/
graph.json
evidence.json
tier.txt
config/sdlc-controls/components.generated.yaml

# JVM crash dumps
hs_err_pid*.log
